<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Sea Grace - 120,000 tonnes Queensland/Kaohsiung end Jan $5.00 fio 40,000/28,000 shinc CSC.</p>
<p>TBN 40,000 tonnes coke Xingang/Piombino 1-15/12 $16.00 Duferco.</p>
<p>ORE - SGC Pioneer - 150,000 tonnes Ponta da Madeira/Rotterdam Dec $5.00 fio six days shinc Rohstoffhandel.</p>
<p>Karoc - 140,000 tonnes Saldanha/ two trips China 10-25/1 $8.00 fio scale load/30,000 shinc Bao Island.</p>
<p>TBN 60,000 tonnes New Mangalore/Kaohsiung 26/12-6/1 high $6.00s CSC.</p>
